      <h1>How AI changes the course of writing</h1>

      <p class="interview-intro">Journalist and editor Tequia Burt interviewed me for a book she is reporting on what writers bring to their work when AI can produce fluent prose. She had read my paper, <em>Early Epistemic Settlement in AI-Assisted Writing</em>, and was interested in how a useful answer might change the inquiry through which a writer develops an argument.</p>
